   clips: a box that clips its own card clips the shadow it throws with it, which
   reads as a card standing in a hole. The card keeps its height and its shadow
   the whole way out and is carried off by the fade instead. The gap between rows
   is the card's own margin, so it is measured by the row that is closing and
